  "description": "Smdn.Devices.MCP2221 is a .NET library for controlling MCP2221/MCP2221A USB2.0 to I2C/UART Protocol Converter with GPIO.\n      This library enables you to control MCP2221/MCP2221A's GPIO, I2C interface, and other functionalities via USB-HID interface.",
